Third-party components
----------------------

This release bundles no third-party source. It links one third-party library,
libcurl, from libs/usd-asset-http alone.

Every other library under libs/ — usd-asset-io and usd-asset-local — depends on
the C++17 standard library and on platform system calls only, and so does the
hostile-server fixture corpus under tests/.

libcurl
-------

https://curl.se

Acquired through find_package and linked privately and statically by
libs/usd-asset-http. No libcurl source is bundled in this repository, and no
libcurl type appears in any header this project installs. The decision and its
grounds are docs/adr/0003-http-client-dependency.md; the criteria it was made
against are docs/design/DESIGN_POLICY.md §13.

